    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d43">

                <pb facs="0157" n="49" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg49"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                        1893</hi></date>. (Received September 15.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson transmits advices received by him to the effect that the revolting
                    squadron, with the apparent purpose of bombarding the city, has ordered merchant
                    vessels in the harbor to move far up the bay.</p>
            </div>
